  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Vacuum eigenvalues and the quantum determinant\n\nOn the HW vacuum |0⟩ = e₁ (A) ⊗ e₄ (F) ⊗ …, T_ij|0⟩ = 0 for i < j and T_aa(u)|0⟩ = V_a(u)|0⟩ with V₁ = (u−θ_A+h)^L(u−θ_F)^L, V₂ = V₃ = (u−θ_A)^L(u−θ_F)^L, V₄ = (u−θ_A)^L(u−θ_F−h)^L. qdet of one site from the 4×4 quantum minor (columns u, u−h, u−2h, u−3h).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[u, x];\nVv[1][L_][x_] := (x - thA + hh)^L (x - thF)^L; Vv[2][L_][x_] := (x - thA)^L (x - thF)^L; Vv[3][L_][x_] := Vv[2][L][x]; Vv[4][L_][x_] := (x - thA)^L (x - thF - hh)^L;\nqdetSite[ty_, t_] := Simplify[Sum[Signature[p] Dot @@ Table[Normal[lax1[ty][u - (k - 1) hh, t][p[[k]], k]], {k, 4}], {p, Permutations[Range[4]]}]];\nqA = qdetSite[\"A\", thA]; qF = qdetSite[\"F\", thF];\nqa = Factor[qA[[1, 1]]]; qf = Factor[qF[[1, 1]]];\ngProd2[L_][x_] := ((x - thA - hh) (x - thF))^L;\ngProd3[L_][x_] := ((x - thA - hh) (x - thA - 2 hh) (x - thF) (x - thF - hh))^L;\ntau4[L_][x_] := ((qa qf)^L) /. u -> x;\nvac2 = Normal[states[\"L2\"][[1]][\"psi\"]]; pv = Ordering[Abs[vac2], -1][[1]];\nGrid[{{\"qdet A site scalar?\", qA == qa IdentityMatrix[4]}, {\"qdet A\", qa}, {\"qdet F site scalar?\", qF == qf IdentityMatrix[4]}, {\"qdet F\", qf},\n  {\"vacuum: τ̄₁(0.37) vs ΣV_a (L = 2)\", {t1b[4][0.37, vac2][[pv]]/vac2[[pv]], Sum[Vv[a][2][0.37], {a, 4}]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"52\" data-out-n=\"545\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"9\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[545]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Expected &#39;$&#39;, got &#39;$̄&#39; at position 1804: …t{vacuum: $\\tau$̲̲̄₁(0.37) vs $\\Si…<br><small>\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{qdet A site scalar?} &amp; \\begin{pmatrix}\\left(u-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(u-\\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\,\\left(u-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(8\\,u^4-52\\,u^3+118\\,u^2-107\\,u+30\\right) &amp; 0 &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; 0 &amp; \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(8\\,u^4-52\\,u^3+118\\,u^2-107\\,u+30\\right) &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(8\\,u^4-52\\,u^3+118\\,u^2-107\\,u+30\\right)\\end{pmatrix}==\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-5\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-3\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right) &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-5\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-3\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right) &amp; 0 &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; 0 &amp; \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-5\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-3\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right) &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-5\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-3\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right)\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{qdet A} &amp; \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-5\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-3\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right)\\\\\\hline\\text{qdet F site scalar?} &amp; \\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{2}\\,u\\,\\left(2\\,u^3-7\\,u^2+7\\,u-2\\right) &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; \\frac{1}{2}\\,u\\,\\left(2\\,u^3-7\\,u^2+7\\,u-2\\right) &amp; 0 &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; 0 &amp; \\frac{1}{2}\\,u\\,\\left(2\\,u^3-7\\,u^2+7\\,u-2\\right) &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; \\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(u-1\\right)\\,\\left(u-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\,u\\end{pmatrix}==\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(u-1\\right)\\,u\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right) &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(u-1\\right)\\,u\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right) &amp; 0 &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; 0 &amp; \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(u-1\\right)\\,u\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right) &amp; 0\\\\0 &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(u-1\\right)\\,u\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right)\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{qdet F} &amp; \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(u-1\\right)\\,u\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right)\\\\\\hline\\text{vacuum: $\\tau$̄₁(0.37) vs $\\Sigma$V\\_a (L = 2)} &amp; \\left\\{0.11769244000000001,0.11769244000000001\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}</small></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[545]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{qdet A site scalar?} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left(u-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(u-\\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\,\\left(u-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) & 0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(8\\,u^4-52\\,u^3+118\\,u^2-107\\,u+30\\right) & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(8\\,u^4-52\\,u^3+118\\,u^2-107\\,u+30\\right) & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(8\\,u^4-52\\,u^3+118\\,u^2-107\\,u+30\\right)\\end{pmatrix}==\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-5\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-3\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right) & 0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-5\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-3\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right) & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-5\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-3\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right) & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-5\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-3\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right)\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{qdet A} & \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\left(u-2\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-5\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-3\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,u-1\\right)\\\\\\hline\\text{qdet F site scalar?} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{1}{2}\\,u\\,\\left(2\\,u^3-7\\,u^2+7\\,u-2\\right) & 0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{2}\\,u\\,\\left(2\\,u^3-7\\,u^2+7\\,u-2\\right) & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2}\\,u\\,\\left(2\\,u^3-7\\,… [latex truncated: 1913 chars total]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "02f68ba9-fa04-43ad-8605-3a7d318a1b3c"
