      {
       "data": "Out[559]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{gauge} & \\text{vacuum (L = 2): dim of polynomial solutions of degree $\\le$ D, D = 0..7}\\\\\\hline\\text{d = V1} & \\left\\{0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{d = V2} & \\left\\{0,0,1,1,1,2,2,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{d = V4} & \\left\\{0,1,1,2,3,3,3,4\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "538bc2cf-b2c7-4ef4-9100-9ea107914112"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Gauge fixed.** The vacuum eigenvalues are τ_a^vac(u) = Σ_{i₁<…<i_a} V_{i₁}(u)V_{i₂}(u−h)⋯V_{i_a}(u−(a−1)h) (checked numerically), so Σ(−1)^a τ_a D^a = (1−V₁D)(1−V₂D)(1−V₃D)(1−V₄D) on the vacuum, D = e^{−h∂}. Kernel of the last factor: Φ(u) = V₄(u)Φ(u−h), so **d = V₄**; the vacuum Q = 1 solves the equation (residual 10⁻¹³). (The rank test of the previous cell used a relative SVD cut that fails for one column — replaced below by a cut relative to the size of the individual terms.) Higher vacuum solutions have degrees L+1, L+2, 2L+3, so Casoratians carry vacuum factors: Q₁₂ := Cas(Q₁, Q₂)/Cas_vac(1, q₂), Q₁₂₃ := Cas(Q₁, Q₂, Q₃)/Cas_vac(1, q₂, q₃).\n\n## 3. Q₁, Q₁₂, Q₁₂₃ for every state",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "baxterParts[tc_, L_, D_] := Module[{tf = tauFull[tc, L], cs = Array[cc, D + 1, 0], Q, d = Vv[4][L]},\n   Q[y_] := cs . y^Range[0, D];\n   Table[With[{B = Expand[(-1)^a tf[[a + 1]][x] Q[x + hh - a hh] Product[d[x - b hh], {b, a, 3}]]},\n     N[Normal[CoefficientArrays[PadRight[CoefficientList[B, x], 4 (2 L) + D + 4 L + 8], cs][[2]]]]], {a, 0, 4}]];\nnullSpace[tc_, L_, D_] := Module[{parts = baxterParts[tc, L, D], M, scale, U, S, V, sv},\n   M = Total[parts]; scale = Max[Norm /@ parts];\n   {U, S, V} = SingularValueDecomposition[M]; sv = Diagonal[S];\n   Transpose[V][[Flatten[Position[PadRight[sv, D + 1], s_ /; s < 10^-9 scale]]]]];\n(* first three solution degrees and solutions; Q_k(y) as coefficient lists *)\nsolveQs[tc_, L_, Dmax_] := Module[{sols = {}, D = 0, ns},\n   While[Length[sols] < 3 && D <= Dmax,\n    ns = nullSpace[tc, L, D];\n    If[Length[ns] > Length[sols], AppendTo[sols, First[SortBy[ns, -Abs[Last[#]] &]]]];\n    D++];\n   sols];\npolyX[c_] := c . x^Range[0, Length[c] - 1];\ncas2[q1_, q2_] := Expand[polyX[q1] (polyX[q2] /. x -> x - hh) - (polyX[q1] /. x -> x - hh) polyX[q2]];\ncas3[q1_, q2_, q3_] := Expand[Det[Table[polyX[q] /. x -> x - j hh, {j, 0, 2}, {q, {q1, q2, q3}}]]];\nmonic[p_] := Expand[p/Coefficient[p, x, Exponent[p, x]]];\nclean[p_] := monic[Chop[Expand[p], 10^-10]];\n(* divide monic Casoratians by the monic vacuum Casoratians; relRem = relative size of the remainder *)\ndivide[p_, pv_] := Module[{a = clean[p], b = clean[pv], q, r}, {q, r} = PolynomialQuotientRemainder[a, b, x];\n   {clean[q], Max[Abs[CoefficientList[r, x]]]/Max[Abs[CoefficientList[a, x]]]}];\nqfunctions[tc_, L_, vacQs_] := Module[{qs = solveQs[tc, L, 4 L + 6], d12, d123},\n   d12 = divide[cas2[qs[[1]], qs[[2]]], cas2[vacQs[[1]], vacQs[[2]]]];\n   d123 = divide[cas3 @@ qs, cas3 @@ vacQs];\n   <|\"degs\" -> ((Length /@ qs) - 1), \"Q1\" -> clean[polyX[qs[[1]]]], \"Q12\" -> d12[[1]], \"Q123\" -> d123[[1]], \"rem\" -> Max[d12[[2]], d123[[2]]]|>];\nKs[dynk_, L_] := Module[{p = dynk[[1]], q = dynk[[2]], r = dynk[[3]], K2}, K2 = L - (p + r)/2 - q; {(L - p + K2)/2, K2, (L - r + K2)/2}];\nvacQ[2] = solveQs[tc2[[1]], 2, 14];\nGrid[{{\"vacuum L = 2: solution degrees\", (Length /@ vacQ[2]) - 1}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"57\" data-out-n=\"593\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"29\" data-sub-end=\"29\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[593]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHt2YWN1dW0gTCA9IDI6IHNvbHV0aW9uIGRlZ3JlZXN9ICYgXGxlZnRcezAsMyw0XHJpZ2h0XH1cXFxobGluZVxlbmR7YXJyYXl9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vacuum L = 2: solution degrees</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:1.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[593]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{vacuum L = 2: solution degrees} & \\left\\{0,3,4\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1548ba99-64fa-4416-919f-aa88bc811d27"
