   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Fix:** all degree mismatches were p ≠ r states with deg = reverse(K): with dyn = [w₁−w₂, w₂−w₃, w₃−w₄] the first Q goes with the *third* label, K₁ = (L − r + K₂)/2, K₃ = (L − p + K₂)/2. With this, every state has deg(Q₁, Q₁₂, Q₁₂₃) = (K₁, K₂, K₃).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Ks[dynk_, L_] := Module[{p = dynk[[1]], q = dynk[[2]], r = dynk[[3]], K2}, K2 = L - (p + r)/2 - q; {(L - r + K2)/2, K2, (L - p + K2)/2}];\nDo[qRows[L] = Table[Append[r, \"K\" -> Ks[r[\"dyn\"], L]], {r, qRows[L]}], {L, {2, 3, 4}}];\nqCheck = Table[{L, Length[qRows[L]], Count[qRows[L], r_ /; r[\"degQ\"] == r[\"K\"]], Max[#rem & /@ qRows[L]]}, {L, {2, 3, 4}}];\nExport[qFile, <|\"description\" -> \"Q-functions (monic polynomials in x = u) of the states in abjm-hw-states.wxf (same order): Q1, Q12, Q123 from the Baxter equation sum_a (-1)^a tau_a(u) Q(u+h-ah) prod_{b=a}^{3} V4(u-bh) = 0 (V4 = vacuum T_44 eigenvalue), Q12, Q123 = Casoratians divided by the vacuum ones. K = magnon numbers (K1 = (L-r+K2)/2, K2 = L-(p+r)/2-q, K3 = (L-p+K2)/2 for dyn = [p,q,r]), degQ = degrees, roots, LR flags: dLR (transfer-matrix defect), LR in Q-language Q1(u) = Q123(u+h). abjm-Qfunctions.wb, 2026-10-12.\",\n    \"L2\" -> qRows[2], \"L3\" -> qRows[3], \"L4\" -> qRows[4]|>, \"WXF\"];\nGrid[Prepend[qCheck, {\"L\", \"# states\", \"# with deg(Q₁, Q₁₂, Q₁₂₃) = (K₁, K₂, K₃)\", \"max Casoratian remainder\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"63\" data-out-n=\"630\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"18\" data-sub-start=\"5\" data-sub-end=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[630]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.84em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">L</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\"